flowchart TD
    A[Real Task] --> B[Decide: human or agent?]
    B --> C[Delegate: which surface?]
    C --> D[Describe: prompt/spec]
    D --> E[Agent Executes]
    E --> F[Discern: review output]
    F -->|needs revision| D
    F -->|accepted| G[Diligence: safety/privacy check]
    G -->|issue found| H[Escalate / revise]
    G -->|clean| I[Ship]
    H --> D
    I --> J[Reflect and record]
    J --> A

    style A fill:#3b82f6,stroke:#60a5fa,color:#fff
    style F fill:#f59e0b,stroke:#fbbf24,color:#000
    style G fill:#8b5cf6,stroke:#a78bfa,color:#fff
    style I fill:#22c55e,stroke:#86efac,color:#000
